# .check-e2e-spec-naming-allowlist
#
# Spec files that live outside e2e/ and are intentionally exempt from
# the location rule enforced by scripts/check-e2e-spec-naming.mjs.
#
# Convention:
#   - Every entry MUST have a "# reason:" comment on the preceding line
#     (or an inline comment on the same line) explaining why the file
#     is outside e2e/ rather than following the standard layout.
#   - Format: one entry per line — path relative to the repo root.
#   - Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#   - Exact-match only (no globs).

